CHANGES
=======

v0.2.0
------

* Rewrite for aprsd 5.0.0+ and python-telegram-bot 22
* Replace ``shortcuts``/``callsign`` with ``aliases``, ``allowed_callsigns``
  and ``enabled``; the bot token now lives in ``apiKey`` only
* Learn each Telegram user's chat id from their first message to the bot
* Replies return to the APRS callsign that last messaged that user
* Shut the polling thread down cleanly; a bad token disables the plugin
  instead of retrying forever

v0.1.3
------

* remove trace

v0.1.2
------

* for v0.1.2
* for v0.1.1
* Use the pbr version of the package as plugin version

v0.1.1
------

* Updated Changelog for v0.1.1
* Fixed a 100% CPU utilization issue

v0.1.0
------

* Updated Changelog
* First version working
* Initial commit
